    "general_information": [
      {
        "type": "GeneralTitle",
        "content": "IMPORTANT MAJOR INFORMATION",
        "groupId": "ddba6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
        "position": 0,
        "area": "General"
      },
      {
        "type": "GeneralText",
        "content": "<p>This Central and East European Languages and Cultures major concentrates on a language and culture of Central and Eastern Europe such as Czech, Polish, Serbian/Croatian, Ukrainian, Hungarian or Romanian. Students are encouraged to become global citizens by giving them the opportunity to gain insight on one of the largest and most powerful regions in the world.</p><p><br></p><p>Listed below are the lower division preparation courses for the major.</p><p><br></p><p>To be considered for admission to this major, you must complete the following courses by the end of spring before transfer:</p><ul><li>One course in introduction to Central, Eastern Europe and Slavic Civilization is <strong>STRONGLY RECOMMENDED</strong> and should be completed by the end of spring before transfer.</li></ul><p>NOTE: If course(s) are not available, applicants must demonstrate sincere interest in the major.</p><p>All courses must be taken for a letter grade.</p><p><br></p><p>For more information regarding this major and UCLA's transfer selection process, visit <u style=\"color: rgb(41, 98, 255);\">https://</u><a href=\"http://www.humnet.ucla.edu/humnet/slavic/undergrad/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">www.slavic.ucla.</a> and <u style=\"color: rgb(41, 98, 255);\">https://</u><a href=\"http://www.admission.ucla.edu\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">admission.ucla.edu</a>.</p><p><br></p><p>PLEASE NOTE: the community college courses listed below have been approved to satisfy the preparation for this major at UCLA, but they may not be exact equivalents of the UCLA courses listed.</p>",
        "groupId": "e0ba6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
        "position": 1,
        "area": "General"
      },
      {
        "type": "GeneralTitle",
        "content": "AP/IB CREDIT",
        "groupId": "5cc97a8f-b7db-472a-8f60-019b9416021c",
        "position": 2,
        "area": "General"
      },
      {
        "type": "GeneralText",
        "content": "<p>No AP or IB exams are considered equivalent, and credit earned from those exams cannot be used towards the Central and East European Languages and Cultures major prep.</p>",
        "groupId": "8224a265-940c-4a7c-8b7f-019b9416021c",
